  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "The narrator frames Trump and his movement as protectors and moral restorers: phrases like \"a fearless soldier for America's return to greatness,\" \"I will fight for you with every breath in my body,\" an \"oath of allegiance to all Americans,\" and appeals to military and law enforcement protection cast the protagonist as a Guardian/virtous stabilizer defending national values."
  },
  "Altruistic_Catalysts": {
