  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "While the passage accuses elites and \"globalists\" of opposing Trump, the language frames them as an entrenched, self-serving establishment (corrupt/institutional) rather than emphasizing covert plots, espionage, or secretive betrayal characteristic of Conspirator/Spy/Deceiver roles."
  },
  "Institutional_Toxins": {
