    "explanation": "Officials and authorities are framed as protectors and coordinators: Puerto Rico Governor Ricardo Rossello urging residents to heed evacuation orders and joining supply missions, the National Weather Service issuing life‑threatening flood warnings, and disaster relief authorities managing evacuations—language positions them as guardians maintaining safety and order."
  },
