  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "State-linked media in Saudi Arabia and the UAE are portraying two Qatari princes as \"distinguished statesmen\" and \"talented decision-makers capable of solving the rift,\" framing them as potential stabilizers/peacemakers or alternative guardians who could resolve the crisis."
