    "explanation": "Qatar is explicitly accused of 'financing terrorism' and 'fomenting unrest' including support for 'sporadic shooting and bombing attacks,' framing it as an initiator of violent or destabilizing actions (Terrorist/Instigator framing)."
  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
