  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "Accusations of dishonesty ('He lies') and hypocrisy leveled at Trump portray him as a deceiver undermining trust, fitting the 'Deceptive Subversives' category of actors who manipulate or mislead."
