  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "The text does not frame any actor primarily as a protector, mediator, or righteous guardian. Officials (interior minister, prime minister) are portrayed as bureaucratic actors under criticism or accepting responsibility rather than as moral guardians or peacemakers."
