  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "Although the ELN made claims about the hostage's activities (accusing him of wanting to smuggle wildlife) and later said he was buried, the piece does not frame actors as covert conspirators, spies, or manipulators operating via secret deception; there is no sustained narrative of clandestine betrayal or misinformation."
