  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "President Obama is framed as a moral and corrective actor adopting Justice Department recommendations and using his authority to reform federal prisons. Phrases like \"I am adopting its recommendations to reform the federal prison system,\" \"this is still a bold and very necessary step,\" and his quoted appeal to \"our common humanity\" cast him as a virtuous/guardian figure stabilizing ethical norms."
  },
  "Altruistic_Catalysts": {
