    "explanation": "Although lawyers and some supporters claim the custody decision is ‘absolutely disproportionate,’ the overall narrative treats the secessionists as active political agents and defendants rather than passive, victimized or forgotten groups; there is insufficient framing of them primarily as sufferers or exploited victims."
