    "explanation": "The narrative includes an accusation of covert wrongdoing: the man claims “They used fraudulent documents to steal my factory and bankrupt me,” framing unnamed parties as engaging in deception to undermine his property and rights."
  },
  "Institutional_Toxins": {
    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "While courts, bankruptcy proceedings and bailiffs are mentioned, the text does not explicitly frame institutions as corrupt or incompetent actors causing systemic failure; allegations concern fraud by unspecified others rather than proven institutional abuse."
