  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "Government leaders and supportive lawmakers are framed as upholding shared values and social cohesion: Prime Minister Malcolm Turnbull’s quoted praise ('What a day for love, for equality, for respect') and lawmakers waving rainbow flags and embracing portray them as affirming justice and fairness. Supportive public figures (Ian Thorpe, Adam Bandt) reinforce a righteous, value-driven framing ('fairness is one of our values', 'Love has won')."
  },
  "Altruistic_Catalysts": {
