    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "The U.S. usage of the term \"Indo-Pacific\" (and Trump/Tillerson's rhetoric) is presented as a politicized/exclusionary reframing that sidelines China — framing the U.S. and like-minded partners as initiators of a political/strategic divide (an instigator of tension)."
  },
  "Deceptive_Subversives": {
