  "Ethical_Stabilizers": {
    "is_used": "Yes",
    "explanation": "Several figures are framed as upholders of democratic values and reconciliation: Cyril Ramaphosa is described as having \"played an important role in the negotiations to end apartheid and in the drafting of South Africa's progressive 1996 constitution,\" which casts him as a peacemaker/guardian/virtuous statesman. Mkhize is described as a \"compromise candidate ... who could reconcile the opposing factions,\" explicitly framing him as a peacemaker."
