    "is_used": "No",
    "explanation": "While sanctions and their effects are discussed, the text does not primarily frame any party as a passive, victimized or forgotten group deserving sympathy; the focus is on diplomatic dispute and reciprocal threats rather than on portraying a marginalized suffering population."
  }
}

